      "text": {
        "en": "Cat owners speak warmly of Dr. Helen Tuzio, Dr. Nanton, and the nursing assistants for their clinical skill and comforting manner during difficult visits. Reviewers value that clinicians listen patiently to owner concerns without rushing. However, a few clients describe past encounters with office management and specific clinicians as blunt or lacking empathy."
