      "title": {
        "en": "Effective diagnostic testing and clinical treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners report successful clinical interventions for complex conditions, including feline eye infections, respiratory issues, and digestive illnesses. Reviewers appreciate that clinicians perform thorough diagnostic testing and develop clear treatment paths. Long-term clients also express gratitude for compassionate, supportive care during chronic cancer management."
      },
      "mentions": 8
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated care tailored exclusively to cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently appreciate the feline-only focus, highlighting that the quiet, dog-free clinic significantly reduces anxiety for nervous patients. Owners note that doctors handle feisty or frightened cats gently during exams and blood draws. The presence of friendly resident hospital cats in the reception area also adds to a uniquely comforting atmosphere."
      },
      "mentions": 7
    }
  ],
